### ============================================================
### TEST SUMMARY
### ============================================================
### These tests cover:
### 1. CRUD Operations: Create, Read, Update, Delete tasks
### 2. Task Statuses: TODO, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, CANCELLED
### 3. Status Transitions: Updating task status with special endpoint
### 4. Pagination: page and limit parameters
### 5. Search: Search by title and description
### 6. Filters:
###    - By status (TODO, IN_PROGRESS, COMPLETED, CANCELLED)
###    - By priority (LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, URGENT)
###    - By assignee (current user with "me")
###    - By creator (current user with "me")
###    - By contact and deal associations
###    - By due date range (from/to)
###    - Overdue tasks filter
### 7. Sorting: By dueDate, priority, createdAt
### 8. Statistics:
###    - Total tasks
###    - Tasks by status
###    - Tasks by priority
###    - Tasks by assignee
###    - Overdue tasks count
###    - Due today count
###    - Due this week count
###    - Completed tasks count
###    - Completion rate (%)
###    - Recently added (last 7 days)
###    - Statistics filtered by user (userId=me)
### 9. Associations: Tasks linked to contacts and deals
### 10. Tenant Isolation: Acme vs TechStart separation
### 11. Validation: Missing required fields, invalid statuses
### 12. Authentication: Token required
### 13. Error Handling: Proper error messages and status codes
### 14. Completion Tracking: completedAt timestamp set automatically
###
### Total Test Scenarios: 45
### ============================================================
